page IconsPage
  Section id:"icons-introduction" py:{ xs:6 md:10 }
    Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:"1fr auto" } gap:5 align:"end"
      Grid columns:1 gap:3
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DEVELOPMENT / PROJECT ICONS"
        Title size:{ xs:"3xl" md:"6xl" } weight:"black"
          "One SVG, every app icon"
        Text size:"lg" color:"muted"
          "Generate web, desktop, iOS, and Android icon sets with the Dowe utilities included in Dowe."
      Button:
        href:"/docs/dev/tests"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"primary"
        size:"sm"
        rounded:"full"
        iconStart:"check-circle"
        "Open Testing docs"
  Section id:"icons-command" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "GENERATION"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Keep the vector source simple"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Use icon.svg in the project root or assets/icon.svg. Dowe asks for the path first, then an opaque hexadecimal background, rounded value, and target selection."
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "The dowe icons namespace only generates application assets. D1 migration utilities use the separate dowe d1 namespace."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy commands"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          dowe icons
          dowe icons --source assets/icon.svg --background '#ffffff' --rounded md
          dowe icons --source icon.svg --background '#111827' --rounded full --target web --target desktop
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "SOURCE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Local SVG only"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "SVG doctypes are accepted without fetching their DTD. External entities are rejected."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "COMPOSITION"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Centered and scaled"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The logo keeps its aspect ratio and occupies at most seventy percent of a square canvas. The macOS ICNS follows Apple's grid, so its surface is the centered eight hundred twenty four pixel square of a one thousand twenty four pixel canvas."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "DEPENDENCIES"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Included in Dowe"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Projects do not need Dowe, Node.js, ImageMagick, or another image utility."
  Section id:"icons-output" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "VERSIONED ASSETS"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Commit assets, regenerate safely"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Dowe writes target folders and a deterministic manifest below icons. Regenerating selected targets removes their stale files and preserves every unselected platform."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy structure"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          assets/
            icon.svg
          icons/
            manifest.json
            web/
            desktop/
            ios/
            android/
        """
      Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
        "Web receives favicon and touch icons. Desktop receives ICO, ICNS, and PNG assets; the ICNS keeps Apple's transparent margin, includes native 1x and 2x sizes, and is applied to both the macOS app and its DMG. iOS receives an AppIcon asset catalog, while Android receives legacy, round, and adaptive launcher resources."
  Section id:"icons-development" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DEVELOPMENT SYNC"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Regeneration reaches every target"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "dowe dev watches icons and synchronizes current copies into disposable .dowe output. Web avoids stale icon caching, desktop hosts consume their native format, and mobile builds receive their launcher resources."
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Web deploys publish only icons/web under /icons. Desktop, iOS, Android, and the source manifest stay outside the public assets upload."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Source of truth"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Commit icons and never edit the copies generated below .dowe."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Native refresh"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "iOS rebuilds its host when icon assets or bundle metadata change."
